### 1. Test Valid Incoming Message (WhatsApp Simulation)
POST https://pleased-reggae-noon-eco.trycloudflare.com/api/webhooks/chatwoot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "message_created",
  "message_type": "incoming",
  "content": "Hola, ¿qué tortas tienen disponibles?",
  "conversation": {
    "id": 4,
    "contact_inbox": {
      "source_id": "59170012345"
    }
  },
  "sender": {
    "name": "Juan Pérez",
    "phone_number": "+59170012345"
  }
}

###

### 2. Test Ignored Event (e.g. conversation_created)
POST https://pleased-reggae-noon-eco.trycloudflare.com/api/webhooks/chatwoot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "conversation_created",
  "id": 4,
  "inbox_id": 2
}

###

### 3. Test Empty Message Content (Should fail content validation)
POST https://pleased-reggae-noon-eco.trycloudflare.com/api/webhooks/chatwoot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "message_created",
  "message_type": "incoming",
  "content": "",
  "conversation": {
    "id": 4,
    "contact_inbox": {
      "source_id": "59170012345"
    }
  },
  "sender": {
    "name": "Juan Pérez"
  }
}

###

### 4. Test Missing Phone Number (Should fail phone validation)
POST https://pleased-reggae-noon-eco.trycloudflare.com/api/webhooks/chatwoot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "message_created",
  "message_type": "incoming",
  "content": "Hola, qué tal",
  "conversation": {
    "id": 4
  },
  "sender": {
    "name": "Juan Pérez"
  }
}

###

### 5. Test Outgoing Message (Should be ignored to prevent loop)
POST https://pleased-reggae-noon-eco.trycloudflare.com/api/webhooks/chatwoot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "message_created",
  "message_type": "outgoing",
  "content": "Esta es una respuesta del bot",
  "conversation": {
    "id": 4,
    "contact_inbox": {
      "source_id": "59170012345"
    }
  },
  "sender": {
    "name": "bot-ia"
  }
}
